,{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Lounges","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7ybQY-BKNvlzEEjIQOkA4g","review_id":"hmse0qXwlty6UISR3yJzqQ","date":"2021-10-12T19:41:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9536294341087341,"text_excerpt":"Aw shucks! We popped over to Seaworthy for happy hour per a recommendation by a colleague and walked away with a belly full of oysters. They unfortunately did not have any Louisiana gulf oysters but we tried a bunch of other varieties and they were super fresh and briny. Louisiana oysters are my favorite so I'll have to come back to try those out. We also got charbroiled oysters - also super delicious and rich. We stopped in specifically for oyster happy hour so I can't speak to the other food here yet, but hopefully I'll make it back sometime soon! Our waiter was very friendly and attentive and we were seated in the side alley way/patio area. The stone, foliage, lighting, and cozy feel r..."},{"business_id":"7ybQY-BKNvlzEEjIQOkA4g","review_id":"YkSwLAlBdtYQRbllbPCpRQ","date":"2018-02-21T16:56:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9534313678741455,"text_excerpt":"We came here for a late brunch after we arrived in NOLA during Mardi Gras weekend. We were seated quickly and the restaurant was about half full. The cocktail selection was impressive so we both ordered cocktails. We also got some oysters - they had a large selection but we decided to stay with gulf coast oysters since we were in the area. They were really good and tasted fresh. I got the seaworthy benedict which had fried oysters. I thought it was delicious. My friend got the crawfish omelet and thought that it was just ok. Overall the service was really good, the place was cute, and I liked the vibe. I would recommend it."},{"business_id":"7ybQY-BKNvlzEEjIQOkA4g","review_id":"eWVYkVd1J4BL345XTQ7WYQ","date":"2019-01-15T20:00:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9471953511238098,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! They have a regular happy hour from 4-6 and a reverse happy hour 11-1 (no oyster deals on the late night menu). Went twice here during my stay. It's a sharp little spot next to the Ace Hotel. Excellent cocktails as well. VERY good quality of oysters from the gulf and from elsewhere. Other items consumed there were squid ink hush puppies (pretty unique!) and Brussels sprouts with bacon-maple jam/sherry vinegar. Really nice balance and contrast there! Oh...grilled octopus was awesome too! This should be on everyone's list downtown. Can't wait to go back!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7ybQY-BKNvlzEEjIQOkA4g","photo_id":"qqm5o5QMXHZdnTi0RFv1ew","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/qqm5o5QMXHZdnTi0RFv1ew.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9101355671882629},{"business_id":"7ybQY-BKNvlzEEjIQOkA4g","photo_id":"xjNhjk3jhsDrrlGss3Alrg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xjNhjk3jhsDrrlGss3Alrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8886278867721558},{"business_id":"7ybQY-BKNvlzEEjIQOkA4g","photo_id":"mDElMwnsgL5D5v8t3oxc5Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mDElMwnsgL5D5v8t3oxc5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8864189386367798},{"business_id":"7ybQY-BKNvlzEEjIQOkA4g","photo_id":"CGPjtpwgRjPBWYQNbbRbCA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CGPjtpwgRjPBWYQNbbRbCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8846716284751892},{"business_id":"7ybQY-BKNvlzEEjIQOkA4g","photo_id":"HGkZGjyMYo0PpAE4NApveg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HGkZGjyMYo0PpAE4NApveg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8394203186035156}]},"notebook_case":null}
